<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Marhold, Marcorp issue cautionary.</title>
<headline>Marhold, Marcorp issue cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarrying companies Marlin Holdings Ltd and Marlin Corp Ltd said on Tuesday they were in talks which could have an impact on their share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
</text>
